WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
Narrator: One day,

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:05.200
a group of penguins were enjoying
themselves in the icy Tundra.

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:09.440
The penguins liked to swim and play and generally do

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:11.620
whatever it is most penguins do.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.940
There was one particular penguin,

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:14.940
however,

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:17.800
who was different than the rest.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.360
And he also was

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:21.320
the littlest penguin.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.200
Mark: Hello Everybody! My name is Markiplier

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.060
and welcome to "The Littlest Penguin".

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:28.560
Now this is a game, about a penguin and

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:31.840
I'm sure it's going to be only lovely and amazing

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:33.480
And everything is gonna turn out great.

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:34.780
Up to Jump- Aww..

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:36.540
Oh, look at the tiny little jump!

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:37.820
Oh-ho-ho

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:38.320
Oh

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:39.700
Oh look at that!

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:41.440
What a little penguin!

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:42.840
Haaabooshky!

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:44.740
Oh! That don't work... apparently.

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:46.560
Hang on! Wai- wait a minute. I'm not a-

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:47.880
I'm not exactly a hundred percent sure

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.760
how to control the littlest penguin here.

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:51.400
Let me dive- oh wow that is scary.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:52.580
*grunting noises*

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:54.840
Mark: There we go!
Narrator: The littlest penguin liked the other penguins

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:56.160
well and fine enough.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.160
Albeit in small doses.

00:00:58.240 --> 00:00:58.740
Mark: Of course.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:01.420
Narrator: He was much more interested in going on adventures

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:03.420
Mark: Yes!
Narrator: And he hoped that today could possibly be

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:05.420
his best adventure yet.

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:06.740
Mark: I would agree.

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:08.300
Thank you so much for allowing

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:11.520
me to go on this epic, incredible adventure

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:12.840
*inhales*

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:15.300
Yeah, nothing dark and sinister *mumbles*

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:16.480
lurking around the corners here-

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:16.980
Whoa!

00:01:16.980 --> 00:01:19.040
Hello! What the hell was that?

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:22.520
That was an awkward scene transition but okay..

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:23.700
Oh!

00:01:24.860 --> 00:01:25.580
Hi!

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:27.260
Uh..

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:28.460
Narrator: Just then,

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:30.220
he discovered a very old,

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:32.220
very sick penguin

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:34.460
lying next to a large stone.

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:36.620
"Wont you please help me?",

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:38.320
cried out the old penguin.

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:41.420
"I am very sick and I am very old."

00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:42.480
"Please."

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:46.020
"Won't you you help fulfill an old penguin's request?"

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:48.240
The littlest penguin agreed,

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:50.400
and was horrified by what

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:52.560
the old penguin said next.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:55.840
"Bash my head in with this stone!"

00:01:55.960 --> 00:01:58.260
"End my pain, littlest penguin!"

00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:01.540
The littlest penguin did as he was told.

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:05.500
Mark: Uh.. don't I have any say in this matter?

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:06.440
Don't I?

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:07.660
Don't I get a little bit of

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:09.340
y'know input on the

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:11.440
adventure that's about to..

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:13.440
unfold before me?

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:17.460
Mark: Oh Gawd! I didn't do anything!
Narrator: Something began to stir inside

00:02:17.460 --> 00:02:19.560
Mark: Oh no...
Narrator: The littlest penguin after that..

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:20.460
Narrator: Suddenly,

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:23.420
Narrator: a rush of emotions he had never known
Mark: *laughing* Oohhhhh noooo!!!

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:24.900
Narrator: filled him,

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:28.760
thrilled him, like nothing had ever done before.

00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:31.580
Mark: *laugh-crying* Oh God..
Narrator: "This Feels like Heaven!",

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:33.600
Mark: Oh Jeez.
Narrator: cried out the littlest penguin,

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:38.660
Narrator: who set out freshly driven. Given new direction to his adventures.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.840
"If killing just one penguin felt that good,"

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:44.840
Mark: Oh nooo
Narrator: He thought to himself.

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:48.920
Narrator: "I wonder how it would be 
if I killed 10 penguins!"

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:50.580
And off he went

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:52.580
to test his theory.

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:55.800
Mark: Again, that way!

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:58.040
Oh, thank you for guiding me!

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:01.280
*laughing* I don't have any choice in the matter.

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:04.340
What happens if I go the other way?

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:06.540
Will I just kill those penguins?

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:10.080
Aw.. I'm just gonna go all the way you tell me to go

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:11.620
*laughing* Oh, no.

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:12.740
Oh, man.

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:13.820
Mark: Oh. 
Narrator: The littlest penguin

00:03:13.820 --> 00:03:16.200
Narrator: came upon a small group of his peers.

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:18.120
"This will do.",

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:19.580
he thought to himself,

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:20.860
picking up a club

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:23.280
that had been lying in the snow

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:24.660
Mark: *heavy breathing*

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:26.680
*laugh-crying*

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.640
*laughing* Ohhhh no...

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:29.180
*sniffles*

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:31.180
It's not such good narration!

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:31.780
*splat*

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:33.880
Mark: *laughing* Oh God! No!
Narrator: The first one went down quickly.

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:35.680
Narrator: Far easier than the littlest penguin

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:36.740
would have thought.

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:38.460
Narrator: This spooked the others,

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:39.820
but to his surprise,

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:42.560
the littlest penguin found, the more they ran

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:44.980
*squelch*
the greater his satisfaction

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:47.160
when he finally beat them down.

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:49.660
And beat them down he did! 
*squelch*

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:51.460
Until the last of them

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.460
were reduced to little more

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:56.420
than a red stain in the snow.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:58.640
Mark: Oh, my God. This is amazing

00:03:58.640 --> 00:04:02.020
and horrifying- *trails off into laughter*

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:03.480
*splat*

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:05.580
It's just so satis- *trails off into laughter*

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:09.360
*laughing*
It's just a sudden thunk

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:11.660
Like, my God!

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:13.740
Just a club lying in the snow

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:16.620
randomly and sporadically and then..

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:19.040
Off to murder we go!

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:21.220
Ohh- Success!

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:24.300
I don't know if I'd call this a success,

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:25.620
but It's a thing!

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:27.280
Narrator: As he moved through the crowd in order to

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:28.720
reach the other side,

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:29.920
the littlest Penguin felt

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:31.360
the eyes upon him.

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:33.960
The other penguins began to grow weary of him,

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:36.320
shifting their gaze as he walked by.

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:39.460
"I do not like the way they stare at me!",

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:41.120
thought the littlest penguin.

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:43.000
"I do not like it one bit!"

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:45.700
"Perhaps, after I kill them all."

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:47.460
"I shall make a fine necklace"

00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:48.620
"of their eyes!"

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:51.320
This thought occupied the littlest penguin

00:04:51.320 --> 00:04:51.960
as the others

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:53.900
wobbled nervously around him.

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:55.400
"And perhaps,"

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:57.860
"A crown made from their beaks."

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:02.320
"So all can see and marvel at how beautiful I am!"

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:04.560
Mark: Okaay.

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:06.060
Alriiiight (;°Д°)

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:07.640
You think that they'd

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:10.760
be doing more than just giving me a shifty look?

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:12.900
Ohhhhh...

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:14.680
Ohh-ho-ho...

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:16.060
*chuckling* Geez...

00:05:16.220 --> 00:05:17.580
Something uh..

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:19.000
something's slightly wrong

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.040
about this little penguin here.

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:22.060
Something uh-

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:25.600
something about being tiny and full of anger.

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:26.840
Something I can relate to

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:28.880
very much, just not to this level.

00:05:28.980 --> 00:05:29.800
Oh boy..

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:31.860
Oh, good. I'm on a platform now.

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:34.780
Is this the stage I shall set for my

00:05:34.780 --> 00:05:36.780
murderous campaign?

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:39.680
Oh... Oh!

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:40.640
Hi!

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:42.080
What the hell is-

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:43.060
Oh!

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:44.240
Oh cool!

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:46.640
An Arctic Research Center!

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:48.800
Whoa.. eh oh!

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:49.620
Ooh!

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:51.400
Narrator: This was more like it,

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:52.740
thought the littlest penguin

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:53.240
Mark: Oh!

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:55.240
Narrator: He could now return to the other penguins

00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:56.640
and make good on his plans.

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:59.020
Mark: Look at that shaky-ass penguin
Narrator: The thought of which triggered an excitement

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:00.380
Narrator: He could hardly contain.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:02.100
Mark: *laughing* Oh no!

00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:05.020
*laughing*
Oh! look how shaky he is

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:07.740
Arrh! Get the penguin murderin' jigglin' fever!

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:11.100
He's- he's just a little dancy fool

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:12.920
Oh boy! Hi friends!!

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:14.180
HELLOO!!!

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:15.420
How are you doing?

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:16.080
Mark: Ohh! G-

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:19.820
Narrator: Faster and faster they fell and brilliant streaks

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:21.960
of crimson filled the air!

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:25.960
Again he would slash at them and again they would cry out!

00:06:26.220 --> 00:06:30.620
Some attempted to vainly cram their entrails back inside

00:06:30.980 --> 00:06:33.660
Others simply fell apart where they stood

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:34.440
Mark: Uuuh!

00:06:34.440 --> 00:06:40.260
Narrator: The Littlest Penguin was thrilled. Oh, how he wished this moment could last forever!

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:42.720
The screams, the panic.

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:45.840
The Rapture that pulsed inside of him!

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:50.460
He could no sooner explain the magic behind his elation

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:52.900
Anymore than he could bring himself to stop.

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:53.900
Mark: Well!

00:06:53.900 --> 00:06:57.920
Narrator: Not until every last penguin had been split apart...

00:06:57.920 --> 00:06:59.400
Mark: *laughing* My goodness.

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:02.600
*laughing* This narrator is good by the way.

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:05.480
Oh, man I really like this story.

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:09.740
Definitely deserved a David Attenborough styled narration.

00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:12.020
My goodness!

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:13.280
Well..

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:18.060
I hope that's the end because HOLY SHIT!

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:20.180
My God.

00:07:22.820 --> 00:07:24.540
Oh, and that's the end!

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.520
Okay, David Mills,

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:28.000
Suits n Noos

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:31.320
Mark: Narration by Balthazar007
Narrator: When the last of them had finally stopped twitching.

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:34.080
Narrator: And he no longer felt the eyes upon him.

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:35.840
The littlest penguin stopped.

00:07:36.420 --> 00:07:39.380
Breathing heavily, he surveyed the destruction

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:40.420
he had wrought.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:41.880
They were all

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:43.600
so beautiful now.

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:46.100
Too beautiful, in fact.

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:48.060
The ecstasy felt

00:07:48.060 --> 00:07:49.220
by the littlest penguin

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:50.660
slowly faded.

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:52.660
And an undeniable sense of

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:53.540
emptiness

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:55.320
Began to take its place

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:57.280
"Its not fair.",

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:58.140
Mark: Oh no..

00:07:58.140 --> 00:07:59.300
Mark: Oh, no.
Narrator: he thought.

00:07:59.300 --> 00:08:01.720
Mark: Oh, no.
Narrator: "They are all so beautiful now."

00:08:01.720 --> 00:08:04.320
Mark: Ohh noo!
Narrator: "Why can't I be beautiful like them?!"

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:06.420
Mark: Oh, God.
Narrator: "Why must I be the only one?!"

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:07.680
Narrator: "It isn't fair!!"

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:09.480
"It just isn't fair!!!"

00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:12.200
The littlest penguin looked at the chainsaw.

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:14.840
Mark: Oh, no!
Narrator: The blood dripped off the teeth of the blade,

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:17.100
Narator: almost glistening in the moonlight

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:18.160
Mark: Oh God!

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:20.200
Narrator: Suddenly, the littlest penguin knew

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:20.740
how to feel

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:22.440
beautiful like the rest.

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:25.700
He knew then, what it was he must do...

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:31.240
*chainsaw sound*
*squelch*

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:32.940
Mark: Oh, God!!

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:34.660
Mark: Ohhh, God!

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:37.100
Ohhh, what a game!

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:38.080
*Narrator begins the story again*

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:40.080
Mark: Oh God! No!! Stop!!

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:41.240
Stop it!

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:43.240
I can't do it again!

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:45.020
Oh!! God, noo!

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:47.020
*narrator continues talking

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:50.000
Oh man! Oh, wow! Ohhh, wow!

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:52.780
What a game! What a game!!

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:55.280
Ohhhh, what a game!

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:57.480
Holy crap!

00:08:58.340 --> 00:09:00.960
Ugh, I think it goes without saying don't go on

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:03.500
a chainsaw murder-suicide spree.

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:05.020
Don't do that.

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:06.520
Holy shit!

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:09.840
Aw, man. So like 10% of me actually enjoyed

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:11.080
that experience,

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:13.440
and then like the other 90% of me

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:15.420
wishes that I could wash my brain

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:17.060
so i never had to experience any of the

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:19.000
bullshit that I just saw.

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:19.740
But either way!

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:21.740
That was "The Littlest Penguin" so

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:23.940
Thank you everybody so much for watching,

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:25.040
for what it was!

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:27.860
*laughing* And I hope you got a laugh maybe?

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:29.040
I dont know so

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:30.240
Thank you again!

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:32.460
Let me know what you thought the deeper meaning

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:33.500
of this game

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:35.260
was, in the comments down below.

